 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The coordinating connector weder … noch",
     "texto": [
      "**Weder … noch** links two parallel syntactic elements negating both together («neither … nor»). The coordinated elements must have identical grammatical category (subjects, direct objects, adjectives or whole clauses): **Weder der Kläger noch der Beklagte legte neue Beweise vor** (Neither the plaintiff nor the defendant presented new evidence)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement and negation rules",
     "texto": [
      "Since **weder … noch** already carries an absolute negative charge in both members, it is strictly forbidden to add **nicht** or **kein** in the same clause. If it links two singular subjects, the verb usually agrees in the singular: **Weder Qualität noch Lieferzeit entspricht den Vereinbarungen**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Type of element",
     "columnas": [
